~ start

PILI: [wave amp=1.2 freq=2]Alright, everyone! Gather around! Let's light the candles![/wave]

#[Pili places the birthday cake in front of Ollie. The candles glow in the dim room.]

VALERIE: Okay, everyone! Ready?

EVERYONE: [wave amp=30 freq=5]Happy birthday to you! Happy birthday to you! Happy birthday, dear Ollie! Happy birthday to you![/wave]

#[Everyone claps and cheers.]

NONI: [wave amp=2 freq=3]Blow them out, Kuya Ollie![/wave]

DODONG: And don't forget to save me the biggest slice!

VALERIE: It's his birthday, Dodong!

DODONG: Exactly! I'm celebrating too!

#[The family laughs.]

PILI: Alright, birthday boy. Close your eyes and make a wish, anak.

ERNESTO: Make it a good one, chief. You're eight now!

OLLIE: [speed=1.1]Hmm... I know what I want.[/speed]

PILI: Don't tell us, or it won't come true!

OLLIE: I won't, Nanay!

#[Ollie closes his eyes and takes a deep breath.]

...

[speed=0.8]I know what to wish for.[/speed]

[speed=0.8]I want everyone to stay together.[/speed]

[speed=0.8]I want tomorrow to be just as happy as today.[/speed]

#[A low rumble rolls beneath the floorboards.]

#[The candle flames flicker. The windows rattle.]

...

ERNESTO: [speed=0.7][shake rate=5 level=3]...Did you hear that?[/shake][/speed]

PILI: It's just thunder, dear.

ERNESTO: [speed=0.6][shake rate=8 level=4][b]That wasn't thunder.[/b][/shake][/speed]

#[The candles suddenly go out.]

OLLIE: [speed=0.8]Huh?[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.7]It's so dark...[/speed]

#[A thin stream of water slips beneath the door and spreads across the floor.]

OLLIE: [speed=0.7]Nanay...?[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.8][shake rate=3 level=2]Why is the floor wet?[/shake][/speed]

NONI: [shake rate=5 level=3]Nay! My feet are cold![/shake]

PILI: [speed=0.8][shake rate=12 level=7][b]Oh, no... no, no, no...[/b][/shake][/speed]

ERNESTO: [speed=1.2][shake rate=10 level=6][b]Everyone, get up! Get away from the door![/b][/shake][/speed]

#[Ernesto rushes to look outside. The sound of rushing water grows louder.]

ERNESTO: [speed=1.2][shake rate=12 level=7][b]The water's coming in! We need to leave![/b][/shake][/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.7][shake rate=3 level=2]But... my birthday...[/shake][/speed]

PILI: [speed=1.2][shake rate=8 level=5][b]Leave the cake, anak! Come here![/b][/shake][/speed]

ERNESTO: [speed=1.2][shake rate=12 level=7][b]Listen to me! Get only what's important! Our documents, medicine, a flashlight, drinking water! Anything you can carry quickly! Leave everything else![/b][/shake][/speed]

VALERIE: [speed=1.2][shake rate=7 level=4]Nay, I'll get the documents![/shake][/speed]

PILI: [speed=1.1][shake rate=6 level=4]They're in the drawer beside our bed! Hurry, anak![/shake][/speed]

ERNESTO: [speed=1.2][shake rate=9 level=5][b]Dodong! Help Valerie with the bags! Noni, stay with your siblings![/b][/shake][/speed]

DODONG: [speed=1.2][shake rate=5 level=3]Got it, Tay![/shake][/speed]

NONI: [speed=0.8][shake rate=4 level=2]But... my toys![/shake][/speed]

VALERIE: [speed=1.1][shake rate=4 level=2]We can get new toys, Noni. Come on![/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.7]New toys?[/speed]

[speed=0.7]What about my birthday presents?[/speed]

#[A loud crash echoes outside. The house shudders.]

KIKI: [speed=1.2][shake rate=18 level=9][b]Nay! Nay![/b][/shake][/speed]

PILI: [speed=1.2][shake rate=10 level=6][b]I'm here, baby! I'm here![/b][/shake][/speed]

ERNESTO: [speed=1.2][shake rate=12 level=7][b]Don't waste time! We need to get everyone out together![/b][/shake][/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.8][shake rate=4 level=2]Tatay... what about our house?[/shake][/speed]

#[Ernesto hesitates, looking at the water spreading across the floor.]

ERNESTO: [speed=0.8][shake rate=4 level=2]...We'll deal with that later, anak. Right now, I need you to stay with your family. Understand?[/shake][/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.8]...Okay, Tay.[/speed]

[speed=0.7]Tatay looks scared.[/speed]

[speed=0.6]I've never seen him look scared before.[/speed]

DODONG: [speed=1.2][shake rate=9 level=5][b]Tay! The water's getting higher![/b][/shake][/speed]

ERNESTO: [speed=1.2][shake rate=12 level=7][b]Everyone, move! Stay together, and don't let go of each other![/b][/shake][/speed]

#[Ollie grabs Noni's hand tightly.]

OLLIE: [speed=1.1][shake rate=5 level=3][b]Hold my hand, Noni. Don't let go, okay?[/b][/shake][/speed]

NONI: [speed=0.7][shake rate=5 level=3]Kuya... I'm scared.[/shake][/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.7][shake rate=4 level=2]Me too...[/shake][/speed]

#[Ollie glances back at the birthday table. The cake sits untouched, its candles scattered across the wet floor.]

My wish...[/speed]

I didn't even make my wish.[/speed]

ERNESTO: [speed=1.3][shake rate=25 level=10][b]OLLIE! NOW![/b][/shake][/speed]

#[Ollie turns and runs after his family as the sound of rushing water swallows the room.]

